* Order flow queues (in addition to MQ developer defaults when MQ_DEV=true)
DEFINE QLOCAL(ORDER.REQ) REPLACE MAXDEPTH(5000)
DEFINE QLOCAL(ORDER.RESP) REPLACE MAXDEPTH(5000)
ALTER QLOCAL(ORDER.REQ) DESCR('Order request queue for Splunk O11y lab')
ALTER QLOCAL(ORDER.RESP) DESCR('Order response queue for Splunk O11y lab')
